QuestGuidance.Register("en",364,{
[11617]="70007B42\n1\tDeliver the gore-crow eyes to Stanric at Ost Guruth\030Collect gore-crow eyes (total: 10)\tGore-crows can be found all along the Great East Road, which lies south of Ost Guruth. Stanric has asked you to search along the Great East Road for gore-crows and collect their eyes as evidence that they can no longer spy upon the people of Ost Guruth.\n",
[11618]="7002FD54\n1\tFish up and defeat the creature\tThe creature can be found in the shallows of the Entwash just west of Snowbourn. Héalac asked you to fish up a creature from the Entwash that is eating fishermen and defeat it.\n2\tTalk to Héalac\tHéalac is at Snowbourn. Héalac will be pleased to know the avanc that was eating his fishermen has been dealt with.\n",
[11619]="7001E4A0\n1\tSummon Mirefang and defeat him\tThe vicious cat Mirefang can be found to the west of Estolad Mernael, near the Pool of Creeping Death. You should summon and defeat this vicious hunter before he decides to hunt you, for his attack is sure to be deadly.\n2\tTalk to Laidhriel at Estolad Mernael\tLaidhriel awaits you at the entrance to Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt, east of Mirefang's lair. You should return to Laidhriel and inform her of your defeat of Mirefang.\n",
[11620]="70068F33\n1\tSpeak with healer standing near the stalls at Bel Inzûl\tSpeak with the healer at the stalls within the outpost of Bel Inzûl.\n",
[11621]="70017E55\n1\tKill some free people!\t\n",
[11622]="7006AE1B\n1\tScout the western entrance\030Scout the northern entrance\tScout the northern and western entrances to Harkhaphâr.\n2\tTalk to Bâkhadir outside of the camp\tReturn to Bâkhadir located just north of Harkhaphâr and return with your scouting report.\n",
[11623]="700200E0\n1\tSpeak with Danath in the Eyes & Guard Tavern\tSpeak with Danath in order to bypass the requirements needed to enter Mirkwood.\n",
[11624]="7003714E\n1\tDefeat enemies within Torsbury (total: 12)\030Scout the south-east gate\030Scout the south-west gate\tEnemies of the Rohirrim can be found within the encampment at Torsbury, north-west of Tordag's encampment. Thane Tordag wants you to test the strength of the enemy at Torsbury and patrol the village gates to see how well they are defended.\n2\tTalk to Thane Tordag at his encampment\tTordag's encampment lies to the south-east of Torsbury, north of the road to Stoke. You should return to Thane Tordag and let him know what you found.\n",
[11625]="70046897\n1\tTalk to a soldier at the sparring area in Aragorn's pavilion\tSoldiers with new armour can be found in the sparring area in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor. Soldiers are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills and test their armour.\n2\tTalk to another soldier at the sparring area in Aragorn's pavilion\tSoldiers with new armour can be found in the sparring area in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor. Soldiers are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills and test their armour.\n3\tTalk to another soldier at the sparring area in Aragorn's pavilion\tSoldiers with new armour can be found in the sparring area in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor. Soldiers are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills and test their armour.\n4\tTalk to another soldier at the sparring area in Aragorn's pavilion\tSoldiers with new armour can be found in the sparring area in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor. Soldiers are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills and test their armour.\n5\tTalk to another soldier at the sparring area in Aragorn's pavilion\tSoldiers with new armour can be found in the sparring area in Aragorn's Pavilion, on the after-battle Pelennor. Soldiers are ready to spar with you in an effort to improve their skills and test their armour.\n6\tTalk to Angbor\tYou should talk to Angbor, who can be found at Aragorn's Pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\n",
[11626]="70022B31\n1\tDefeat Thadúr the Ravager\tThadúr the Ravager, an ancient warrior, has arisen deep within the watery depths of the Great Barrow.\n",
[11627]="70025B75\n1\tWork with Nadfaron\030Work with Brogdagnir\030Work with Gúrhebnir\tNadfaron, Brogdagnir and Gúrhebnir are all at Tinnudir. Orchalwë has asked you to work with three of the other Rangers in driving the goblins from Tham Andalath.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë is at Tinnudir. Orchalwë will be pleased to hear Tham Andalath has been cleared of goblins.\n",
[11628]="70026935\n1\tDefeat goblins at Tham Andalath (total: 12)\030Extinguish the camp-fires (total: 8)\tTham Andalath is north east of Tinnudir, east of Tham Ornen. Orchalwë's journal speaks next of Tham Andalath, a ruin of a great weaponsmith's home, now defiled by goblins.\n",
[11629]="70025B33\n1\tWork with Nadfaron\030Work with Brogdagnir\030Work with Gúrhebnir\tNadfaron, Brogdagnir and Gúrhebnir are all at Tinnudir. Orchalwë has asked you to work with three of the other rangers to help Tham Nambarth.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë is at Tinnudir. Orchalwë will be pleased to hear that Tham Nambarth should be safe for the near future.\n",
[11630]="7002690D\n1\tDefeat elk at Tham Nambarth (total: 6)\030Tear down ivy at Tham Nambarth (total: 6)\tTham Nambarth is in the Twilight Fields, east of Tinnudir. Orchalwë's journal details several things that are currently assailing the ruins of Tham Nambarth.\n",
[11631]="70025B6E\n1\tWork with Nadfaron\030Work with Brogdagnir\030Work with Gúrhebnir\tNadfaron, Brogdagnir and Gúrhebnir are all at Tinnudir. Orchalwë has asked you to work with three of the other rangers to discover Angmar's intent in Tham Ornen.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë is at Tinnudir. Orchalwë will be interested to hear what you discovered within Tham Ornen.\n",
[11632]="70026934\n1\tDefeat Angmarim at Tham Ornen (total: 8)\030Destroy Angmarim orders at Tham Ornen (total: 4)\tTham Ornen is north east of Tinnudir. Orchalwë's journal speaks next of Tham Ornen, a ruin now controlled by a scouting force from Angmar.\n",
[11633]="70025B38\n1\tWork with Nadfaron\030Work with Brogdagnir\030Work with Gúrhebnir\tNadfaron, Brogdagnir and Gúrhebnir are all Tinnudir. Orchalwë has asked you to work with three of the other rangers to recover the identity of Tham Varan.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë is at Tinnudir. Orchalwë will be pleased to hear that Tham Varan's identity has been learned and its history protected.\n",
[11634]="7002690E\n1\tDefeat tomb-robbers at Tham Varan (total: 6)\tTham Varan is east of Tinnudir and Tham Nambarth. Orchalwë's journal speaks next of Tham Varan, a ruin of unknown ownership besieged by tomb-robbers.\n",
[11635]="70037B8F\n1\tTalk to Thane Léoferth\tThane Léoferth is inside the mead hall which is near the centre of Brockbridge.\n2\tTalk to Dunith\tDunith has long been Thane Léoferth's hand-maiden, and stays near his side to aid him in his regressing health. You should speak with Dunith.\n3\tCollect dirty dishes\tThere is a pile of dirty dishes near Thane Léoferth's bed. Dunith asked you to collect the dirty dishes.\n4\tBring dishes to the cook\tThe kitchen is in the corner of the Mead Hall in Brockbridge. Dunith asked you to take the dirty dishes to the cook to be washed.\n",
[11636]="700453E2\n1\tMourn the loss of Bhai-buri-Ghân\030Mourn the loss of Bhai-buri-Ghân by the Dhûrghud\tThe sacred Dhûrghud tree is located in Drû Bhûta. You should pay your respects to Bhai-buri-Ghân by the Dhûrghud.\n2\tMeditate to clear your mind under the sacred Dhûrghud\030Meditate the clear your mind under the sacred Dhûrghud\tThe sacred Dhûrghud tree is located in Drû Bhûta. You should pay your respects to Bhai-buri-Ghân by the Dhûrghud.\n3\tSpeak with Ghân-buri-Ghân\tGhân-buri-Ghân is in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân.\n",
[11637]="7006C08C\n1\tRepair supplies collected (total: 7)\tMaterials to repair the walls can be found scattered throughout TBD. TBD has asked for your help playing courier and collecting supplies from around the city.\n2\tReturn to TBD Frustrated Carpenter\tTBD Frustrated Carpenter can be found at TBD. You have collected a reasonable amount of supplies TBD Frustrated Carpenter can use to repair the walls of Jirush. Return to him with your findings.\n",
[11638]="7005D3A0\n1\tCollect stolen gems\tAnatrâd lies in north-western Clovengap. You should recover the stolen gems from the hobgoblins of Anatrâd.\n2\tCollect stolen gems (total: 12)\tAnatrâd lies in north-western Clovengap. You should recover the stolen gems from the hobgoblins of Anatrâd.\n3\tReturn to Gerja\tGerja is in Bazanmanar in north-eastern Clovengap. You should bring the stolen gems to Gerja.\n",
[11639]="70067F77\n1\tDeliver the sea-shells to Elbatra in Rakhatâb\030Collect sea-shells ([see journal]/12)\tElbatra asked that you go to the shoreline and gather up ornate sea-shells. She cautioned that you should be wary of the creatures that roam the shore; specifically, the crabs. Gather the shells and return them to Elbatra at Rhakatâb.\n",
[11640]="700097E1\n1\tUse bow near Gwindeth\030Use kneel near Gwindeth\030Use salute near Gwindeth\tThe Blue Lady is at Gwindethrond, behind the waterfall at Rushingdale in western Emyn Uial. Gwindeth has given you her final task, the task that Aragorn was unable to complete seventy years before: to give her that which she values most.\n2\tTalk to Gwindeth\tThe Blue Lady is at Gwindethrond, behind the waterfall at Rushingdale in western Emyn Uial, in Evendim. You have given Gwindeth that which she desires most, and that which the kings of Arnor gave to her -- respect. She is waiting to speak with you.\n3\tTalk to Calenglad\tCalenglad is at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, east and slightly north of Rushingdale, in Evendim. Gwindeth has agreed to allow you access to the tomb of Elendil, where you can recover the Silithar for Aragorn.\n",
[11641]="7002FF08\n1\tCollect reeds near Walstow (total: 7)\tReeds can be found along the stream to the south-west of Walstow. Winsig wants you to aid the crofters of Walstow in repairing their rapidly deteriorating town. The reeds along the nearby stream should be suitable for repairing rooves.\n2\tTalk to Winsig\tWinsig can be found inside the Mead Hall of Walstow. You should return to Winsig with news of your success.\n",
[11642]="70064394\n1\tExplore the halls of Thaurisgar\tThaurisgar houses many a foul and twisted creature and the vile ingredients of Angmarim alchemy. You should investigate all that this apothecary contains.\n2\tUnlock the door to the lower levels\tThe doors to the lower levels of Thaurisgar seem to be locked. Find the mechanism that unlocks the door.\n3\tFind a way to open the apothecary doors\tYou found another door, but there is no keyhole. Perhaps there is a mechanism that can open this door. Look for clues for how to open the door to the main apothecary.\n4\tFind and defeat Kurja and Kârsija\tThe apothecary has been overrun by the alchemists' most twisted experiments. They are protecting the vital research left by Aniochán the Harrower. You should defeat the twins.\n",
